{"id":"8160ac3d14bcbf65","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-birkhoff.md","title":"Birkhoff Ergodic Theorem","display":"thm-birkhoff — Birkhoff Ergodic Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-birkhoff","aliases":["58-thm-birkhoff"],"display":"thm-birkhoff — Birkhoff Ergodic Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-ergodic]]","[[58-df-time-average]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-birkhoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-birkhoff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-birkhoff — Birkhoff Ergodic Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11a66aa01f6e941d\" href=\"?note=11a66aa01f6e941d\" title=\"58-df-ergodic\">58-df-ergodic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b66d1b59b418b03\" href=\"?note=5b66d1b59b418b03\" title=\"58-df-time-average\">58-df-time-average</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56239458358186f6\" href=\"?note=56239458358186f6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md\">../batch01/58-df-integrability.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (probability space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:X\\to X\">\\(T:X\\to X\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-measurable, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-preserving transformation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"56239458358186f6\" href=\"?note=56239458358186f6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (integrable function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S\\)</span> (invariant-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"56239458358186f6\" href=\"?note=56239458358186f6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}birkhoff}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land \\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S(\\mu,T;X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists f^*\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f^*,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\left\\{x\\in X:f^*(x)\\neq\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}f(T^i(x))\\right\\}\\right)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7.5em}\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\{x\\in X:f^*(T(x))\\neq f^*(x)\\}\\right)=0\n\\land\\int_Xf^*\\,d\\mu=\\int_Xf\\,d\\mu\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}birkhoff}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land \\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S(\\mu,T;X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists f^*\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f^*,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\left\\{x\\in X:f^*(x)\\neq\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}f(T^i(x))\\right\\}\\right)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7.5em}\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\{x\\in X:f^*(T(x))\\neq f^*(x)\\}\\right)=0\n\\land\\int_Xf^*\\,d\\mu=\\int_Xf\\,d\\mu\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Birkhoff's ergodic theorem gives pointwise convergence; both the input and limit functions are now typed by the explicit integrability predicate.</li>\n<li>The limit function is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-invariant almost everywhere and preserves the integral; when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is ergodic it is almost everywhere constant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ergodic","status":"resolved","id":"11a66aa01f6e941d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ergodic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-time-average","status":"resolved","id":"5b66d1b59b418b03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-time-average]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"56239458358186f6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)$ (probability space, see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"56239458358186f6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T:X\\to X$ ($\\Sigma$-measurable, $\\mu$-preserving transformation, see [[../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"56239458358186f6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S$ (invariant-measure predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-invariant-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"T:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}birkhoff}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land \\mathrm{InvariantMeasure}_S(\\mu,T;X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists f^*\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f^*,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\left\\{x\\in X:f^*(x)\\neq\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}f(T^i(x))\\right\\}\\right)=0\\\\\n&\\hspace{7.5em}\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\{x\\in X:f^*(T(x))\\neq f^*(x)\\}\\right)=0\n\\land\\int_Xf^*\\,d\\mu=\\int_Xf\\,d\\mu\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1658,"backlinks":[{"id":"272415f46291f82d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4046","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-birkhoff.md|58-thm-birkhoff]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["11a66aa01f6e941d","5b66d1b59b418b03","0578a357a86e9d8f","56239458358186f6","7df291a6731ae8a3"]}